✅ Step 1: Create Files

Create a folder (example: xml-bookstore)

Inside it, create 2 files:

1️⃣ books.xml

Paste your XML code

2️⃣ index.html

Paste your HTML + JavaScript code

✅ Step 2: Open in VS Code

Open the folder in Visual Studio Code

❗ Step 3 (IMPORTANT)

👉 DO NOT open index.html by double-click

It will NOT work (XML won’t load)

✅ Step 4: Use Live Server
Install extension → Live Server
Right-click on index.html
Click "Open with Live Server"
✅ Step 5: Run
Browser will open automatically
Click “Show Books” button
✅ Output

👉 You will see:

Title	Author	Price
Java	James	500
Python	Guido	600
